msgid "Global gate for fullcone NAT. Turn it on here, then opt in per zone on the Firewall page, where it can also be limited to specific protocols."
msgstr "全锥形 NAT 的全局总开关。在此启用后，再到「防火墙」页面按区域分别开启，并可限定只对特定协议生效。"

msgid "Global gate for fullcone NAT on IPv6. Most IPv6 setups do not need fullcone."
msgstr "IPv6 的全锥形 NAT 全局总开关。大多数 IPv6 环境不需要全锥形 NAT。"

