# --- fullcone NAT (added by the fullcone branch) ---

msgid "SONiC Fullcone"
msgstr "SONiC 全锥形 NAT(nft_masq 内置)"

msgid "Fullcone NAT"
msgstr "全锥形 NAT"

msgid "Fullcone NAT (IPv4)"
msgstr "全锥形 NAT(IPv4)"

msgid "Fullcone NAT (IPv6)"
msgstr "全锥形 NAT(IPv6)"

msgid "Global switches"
msgstr "全局开关"

msgid "Per-zone control"
msgstr "按区域控制"

msgid "Zone"
msgstr "区域"

msgid "IPv4 masquerading"
msgstr "IPv4 伪装"

msgid "Protocols"
msgstr "协议"

msgid "UDP-Lite"
msgstr "UDP-Lite"

msgid "Endpoint-independent mapping and filtering for masqueraded traffic. The kernel keeps a second hash table inside conntrack, keyed by the translated 3-tuple (protocol, source address, source port), so peers can reach a client from an address it never contacted."
msgstr "为伪装的流量提供端点无关的映射与过滤。内核在 conntrack 内维护第二张哈希表，以转换后的三元组（协议、源地址、源端口）为索引，因此对端可以从客户端从未联系过的地址主动访问它。"

msgid "These are master gates. With a gate off, no zone gets fullcone regardless of its own setting."
msgstr "这里是总闸。任一家族的总闸关闭时，无论区域如何设置都不会启用全锥形 NAT。"

msgid "Master gate for IPv4 fullcone."
msgstr "IPv4 全锥形 NAT 的总闸。"

msgid "Master gate for IPv6. Most IPv6 setups do not need fullcone."
msgstr "IPv6 的总闸。大多数 IPv6 环境不需要全锥形 NAT。"

msgid "Fullcone only takes effect on zones that masquerade IPv4 traffic, normally just the wan zone."
msgstr "全锥形 NAT 只对启用了 IPv4 伪装的区域生效，通常只有 wan 区域符合。"

msgid "Enable fullcone for this zone. Uncheck to keep plain masquerading here."
msgstr "为本站区启用全锥形 NAT。取消勾选则本站区保持普通伪装。"

msgid "Restrict fullcone to the selected L4 protocols; every other protocol keeps plain masquerading. Leave empty to apply fullcone to all protocols."
msgstr "限定全锥形 NAT 只对选中的 L4 协议生效，其余协议仍走普通伪装。留空表示对所有协议生效。"




